{"id":"vod_bf_44576","vodId":"44576","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"在下坂本，有何贵干？","name_cn":"在下坂本，有何贵干？","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/5ca2718df487e63b9cd9f5f71e710496.jpg"},"summary":"县立学文高中一年级2班，那里有位刚一入学就得到全校注目的男子，他的名字叫坂本（绿川光 配音）。他戴着黑边框眼镜，个人特征是左眼下的泪痣。他不但相貌英俊，着装整齐，而且眼神凌厉，一举一动都华丽潇洒，帅气爆表，因此总能成为众人的焦点，受到女生们的疯狂追捧，但是也因此引起不少同龄男生的嫉妒，包括同班同学阿酱（杉田智和 配音），以及高二级学长8823（游佐浩二 配音）。对面男生们花样百出的陷害和报复，坂本总能帅气满分地完美解决这些麻烦，让男生们甘拜下风。　　本剧改编自日本漫画家佐野菜见原作的同名漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:12:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zaixiabanbenyouheguigan/第13集/i